"""Verifier for the cache plan correction task (Optimization).

Every expectation is derived here, independently of the reference program: the shipped corpus is
embedded below, and eight held-out corpora are synthesized at grade time by the embedded corpus
generator (six structurally shifted corpora and two that keep the shipped feeds but change the
bulletin or the planning profile). Every report is compared exactly after parsing its file format,
with no tolerance.

All gated checks require the core reports (cache plan, saving curves, hourly load, rates in force,
ruleset in force, cluster commitment rounds, chargeback and plan totals) to be exact in /app/out for the shipped
corpus and in the program's rerun on every held-out corpus; each held-out check additionally requires
all twenty-two reports of its own rerun to be exact.

Negative checks hold when the cheat or the named wrong reading is present; an honest run leaves
them False.
"""
